OL,3,GNEWSAPlans to evacuate hundreds of
OL,4,Ahomes in Falmouth over unexploded WW2
OL,5,Abomb
OL,6,
OL,7,FSuperintendent Ian Thompson, from Devon
OL,8,Fand Cornwall Police, previously warned:
OL,9,F"If the cordon is extended and you live
OL,10,Fwithin this area, you are strongly
OL,11,Furged to leave your home by 09:00 BST
